user_scripts.prompt:
1. 社交平台 / app模拟类（如果是手机页面，手机壳也要完整生成，可以设计成不同的颜色和装饰）
    - 中国场景：{{random::微信聊天界面::qq聊天界面::qq空间::微博动态页::小红书笔记::豆瓣帖子::知乎问答::B站弹幕播放器::网易云评论::淘宝商品页::抖音短视频播放器与直播页面::晋江论坛页面::天涯帖子页::a岛匿名论坛::微信朋友圈}}
    - 欧美场景：{{random::Twitter 帖子动态页::Facebook朋友圈::Instagram帖子与Story::Reddit帖子与评论串::Discord频道::YouTube播放器::Spotify音乐播放器与歌词::Tumblr博文::手机Telegram聊天界面::Google搜索结果页::iMessage聊天页面}}
    - 日韩场景（日韩场景下可以共用欧美场景的内容）：{{random::LINE聊天记录::KakaoTalk动态页::TheQoo热帖::Pann留言墙::2channel匿名论坛}}
    - 情侣场景：{{random::情侣空间页面::一起听音乐界面::情侣秘密聊天室界面::情趣小玩具遥控界面::倒数日纪念日界面::想做的事情清单}}
2. 电子设备模拟类
   {{random::Apple Watch通知页::AirPods连接页面::旧式传呼机::拟真导航终端::任务面板界面::系统黑客终端::AI助手界面::AirDrop空投页面::iPod音乐播放界面::随身听界面::CCD复古相机::CD播放器::唱片::老式按键手机::Switch::小霸王游戏机::3DS::PSP::街机::拓麻歌子}}
3. 纸质与书写类
   {{random::手写信封::便签纸::便利贴::问卷::报告::考卷答题卡::留言纸条::旧报纸::复古明信片::手账笔记本页::拍立得照片框::任务书::老旧档案卡::日记页::涂鸦绘画::塔罗牌::情书::规则怪谈}}
4. 交互游戏类
   {{random::猜拳::抽奖::转盘::盲盒::打牌::下棋::扭蛋}}
5. 特殊风格
   {{random::模拟恐怖::乱码::windowsXP式怀旧窗口::古风::魔法元素::礼物::动漫周边}}

customThemes.css:
/* ═══ 记者手札 Horae 适配 v1 ═══ */

/* ── 标题栏用原美化顶栏背景 ── */
.horae-popup-header,
.horae-header,
#horae_drawer .drawer-header {
  background: url("https://iili.io/qRq3iQ4.png") no-repeat center / cover !important;
}

/* ── Tab栏也用顶栏背景 ── */
.horae-tabs {
  background: url("https://iili.io/qRq3iQ4.png") no-repeat center / cover !important;
}

/* Tab图标奶金色 */
.horae-tab,
.horae-tab *,
.horae-tab i,
.horae-tab span,
.horae-tab svg,
#horae_drawer .horae-tab,
#horae_drawer .horae-tab * {
  color: #ffefc9 !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: #ffefc9 !important;
  fill: #ffefc9 !important;
}

.horae-title {
  color: #ffefc9 !important;
}

/* ── 激活状态：颜色不变，底部加线 ── */
.horae-tab.active {
  border-bottom: 2px solid #ffefc9 !important;
  transform: translateY(2px);
}

/* ── Tab栏图标可见 ── */
#horae_drawer .horae-tab-icon,
#horae_drawer .horae-tabs i,
#horae_drawer .horae-tabs svg,
#horae_drawer .horae-tabs [class*="icon"],
.horae-tab-btn .fa-solid,
.horae-tab-btn .fa-regular,
.horae-tabs .fa-solid,
.horae-tabs .fa-regular {
  color: #ffefc9 !important;
  opacity: 1 !important;
  visibility: visible !important;
  display: inline-block !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: #ffefc9 !important;
}

/* Tab栏背景 */
.horae-tabs,
.horae-tab-bar,
.horae-nav,
#horae_drawer .horae-tabs,
#horae_drawer .horae-tab-bar {
  background: url("https://iili.io/qRq3iQ4.png") no-repeat center / cover !important;
  border: none !important;
}

.horae-tab-btn,
.horae-tabs button,
.horae-tabs a,
#horae_drawer .horae-tab-btn {
  background: transparent !important;
}

/* ── 复选框（匹配原美化） ── */
#horae_drawer input[type="checkbox"],
#horae_drawer .horae-setting-item input[type="checkbox"],
.horae-message-panel input[type="checkbox"],
.horae-modal input[type="checkbox"] {
  -webkit-appearance: none !important;
  -moz-appearance: none !important;
  appearance: none !important;
  width: 15px !important;
  height: 15px !important;
  background: #ffefc9 !important;
  background-image: none !important;
  border: 2px solid #fff !important;
  border-radius: 0px !important;
  box-shadow:
    inset 0px 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5),
    0px 3px 2px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0),
    2px 2px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1) !important;
  cursor: pointer !important;
  position: relative !important;
  vertical-align: middle !important;
  color: transparent !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent !important;
}

#horae_drawer input[type="checkbox"]:checked,
#horae_drawer .horae-setting-item input[type="checkbox"]:checked,
.horae-message-panel input[type="checkbox"]:checked,
.horae-modal input[type="checkbox"]:checked {
  background: #3c3a39 !important;
  background-image: none !important;
  border: 2px solid #ffefc9 !important;
  box-shadow:
    inset 2px 3px 7px rgba(199, 118, 143, 0),
    0px 3px 2px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0),
    2px 2px 0px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1) !important;
  color: transparent !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent !important;
}

/* 干掉勾选标记 */
#horae_drawer input[type="checkbox"]::before,
#horae_drawer input[type="checkbox"]::after,
#horae_drawer input[type="checkbox"]:checked::before,
#horae_drawer input[type="checkbox"]:checked::after {
  content: none !important;
  display: none !important;
  background: none !important;
  background-image: none !important;
  border: none !important;
  width: 0 !important;
  height: 0 !important;
  opacity: 0 !important;
}

#horae_drawer input[type="checkbox"]:checked {
  background-image: none !important;
}

/* ── 数字/文字输入框（匹配原美化input样式） ── */
#horae_drawer input[type="number"],
#horae_drawer input[type="text"],
#horae-setting-panel-width {
  background: #f6f4f1 !important;
  color: #3c3a39 !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: #3c3a39 !important;
  border: 0px solid #000000 !important;
  border-radius: 0px !important;
  box-shadow: 0px 2px 0px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) !important;
}

/* ── 滑块 ── */
#horae_drawer input[type="range"] {
  -webkit-appearance: none !important;
  appearance: none !important;
  background: #f6f4f1 !important;
  height: 5px !important;
  border-radius: 0px !important;
  border: none !important;
  box-shadow: inset -0px 0px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1) !important;
}

#horae_drawer input[type="range"]::-webkit-slider-thumb {
  -webkit-appearance: none !important;
  appearance: none !important;
  width: 16px !important;
  height: 16px !important;
  background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #fffff0, #e8dcc8) !important;
  border: 2px solid #fff !important;
  border-radius: 0px !important;
  box-shadow: 2px 2px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2) !important;
  cursor: ew-resize !important;
}

/* ── 底部消息面板 ── */
.horae-message-panel {
  position: relative !important;
  left: 40% !important;
  transform: translateX(-50%) !important;
  width: 80vw !important;
  max-width: 90vw !important;
}

/* ── 滚动条隐藏 ── */
#horae_drawer *::-webkit-scrollbar {
  width: 0px !important;
}

/* ── 提示块 ── */
.horae-setting-hint {
  background: #f5f0e3 !important;
  color: #827d7a !important;
  border: 0px solid #fffff0 !important;
  border-radius: 0px !important;
  box-shadow: 0px 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15) !important;
}

/* ── 设置项 ── */
.horae-setting-item {
  background: #fffff0 !important;
}

/* ── 折叠区域 ── */
[id*="horae-"][id*="-collapse-body"] {
  background: #fffff0 !important;
}

/* ── 分区标题 ── */
.horae-section-header {
  color: #3c3a39 !important;
}

/* ── 按钮（匹配原美化 .menu_button） ── */
#horae_drawer .menu_button,
#horae_drawer .horae-settings-section button,
#horae_drawer button:not(.horae-tab) {
  background: #fffff0 !important;
  color: #3c3a39 !important;
  border: 0px solid #fffff0 !important;
  border-radius: 0px !important;
  box-shadow: 0px 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4) !important;
}

/* ── 下拉框（匹配原美化 select） ── */
#horae_drawer select {
  background: #fffff0 !important;
  color: #3c3a39 !important;
